  "id": "necker-cube",
  "term": "Necker cube",
  "definition": "The Necker cube is an ambiguous drawing of a cube that can be seen in two roughly equally likely three-dimensional ways. When people look at it, perception often flips suddenly and seemingly spontaneously from one interpretation to the other.",
